  "body": "Five brand-new homes in one of East Auckland's most sought-after school zones! Whether you're a first-home buyer, young family or investor, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a modern, low-maintenance home in a premium Half Moon Bay location.\r\n\r\nAll five homes offer three bedrooms, including a master ensuite, modern kitchens, practical living spaces and one dedicated off-street parking space.\r\n\r\nFive Homes – Your Choice!\r\n\r\nLot 1 – Freestanding \r\n• The largest home, with three bedrooms plus a study\r\n• Two full bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Two bedrooms and study upstairs, third bedroom and bathroom downstairs\r\n• Separate living and kitchen/dining spaces\r\n\r\nLots 2, 3 and 4 – Attached Homes\r\n• Three bedrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• One additional full bathroom plus guest toilet\r\n• Two bedrooms upstairs, third bedroom downstairs\r\n• Modern kitchen, dining and living spaces\r\n\r\nLot 5 – Attached Home \r\n• Three bedrooms upstairs, including a master ensuite\r\n• One additional full bathroom plus guest toilet\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living downstairs\r\n\r\nTop School Zones – All Within Walking Distance!\r\n• Pigeon Mountain Primary – approx. 472m\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate – approx. 671m\r\n• Macleans College – approx. 1.0km\r\n\r\nLocation, Lifestyle and Convenience!\r\nEnjoy easy access to Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry terminal, local cafés, restaurants and shops. Pigeon Mountain, Glenandrew Park and Half Moon Park are all nearby, offering fantastic outdoor green spaces for the whole family.\r\nWith excellent schooling, coastal attractions and convenient transport connections, this is a location that truly has it all!\r\n\r\nFive brand-new homes, different layouts and an unbeatable location – don't miss this opportunity!\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!",
